<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX index ends officially at 5,929.87 pt.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX index ends officially at 5,929.87 pt.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange closed officially at 5,929.87 points, down 14.59, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 4.60 billion forints.</p>
<p>BUX futures dipped for all maturities, by between 29.50 and 160.00 points.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
